Z||000000||SCFIERO||12-12-2000||06:00 PM||||As you probably have seen in my other comments, I have an 86 GT that I have taken completely apart.  Now I am wondering which direction I should go in.  Chop the Top?, Add V8, Add sunroof, Completely restore?, or add a lambo or ferrari kit to it.  Any suggestions you guys would be great.  ||||reg||5
Z||000001||88formula||12-12-2000||06:49 PM||||Do what you feel you want the most. Think about what you really want. Do you like the GT style? If so than restore it. Do you want something different? If so than do a kit car. Do you want tons of torque? If so than get the v8 engine. If you chop the top will you fit in the car and will it be safe? Only you know the answer to your question.||||reg||1
